CERLPDR@TECHNION.BITNET writes:

>I'm trying to install NetHack on an Olivetti PC. My first attempt ended in
>failure. Apparently the graphics are not compatible.....

Its really too bad that the frequently asked questions don't have this
in it for PC users, but Nethack's character based graphics *REQUIRE*

     device=c:\dos\ansi.sys

or something similar in your CONFIG.SYS file.  Feel free to change the
path... there are also more efficient ANSI.SYS replacements available
that could be used as well.
